# Audit artefacts. Working documents, not source: a report describing the code
# at one commit goes stale the moment the next one lands, and a stale audit
# committed beside the code it no longer describes is worse than no audit.
# Deliberately NOT deleted -- they are useful locally, just not tracked.
AUDIT_REPORT.md
audit-page.html

# The local agent worktrees and session scratch. Not source, and a worktree
# committed into the repo it is a worktree OF is a loop nobody wants to debug.
.claude/

# Browser tests. The suite AND its lockfile are tracked -- an unpinned
# Playwright is a CI run that breaks on somebody else's release. The browser
# download, the throwaway database and the reports are not.
e2e/node_modules/
e2e/playwright-report/
e2e/test-results/
e2e/.data/
